<title>UK: Grampian, Scottish Media offer at 320p/share.</title>
<headline>Grampian, Scottish Media offer at 320p/share.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Grampian Television Plc on Monday confirmed it was in talks with Scottish Media Group Plc which may lead to a merger of the two companies.</p>
<p>Grampian said in a statement that any merger would be effected by means of an offer by Scottish Media for Grampian in the region of 320 pence per Grampian share.</p>
<p>It added that a further announcement would be made as soon as was &quot;appropriate&quot;.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
